{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269QNb5LVWBf1794733130.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>女子網球年終賽，安迪莉娃擊敗佩古娜，晉級決賽。</p><p></p><p>藍色裙的安迪莉娃首盤先失發球局，不過這位世界第三球手，之後回敬兩次破發，反勝6-3。佩古娜在年終賽前的訓練環節，被官方意外收錄她與教練的私下對話，當時她指安迪莉娃「耍大牌」，不過雙方很快就和解。</p><p></p><p>19歲的安迪莉娃在第二盤再次逆轉勝，贏多盤6-4，生涯首次打入年終賽決賽，亦是以一盤不失姿態晉級，將會對施維杜蓮娜。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T09:58:47.245579+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T08:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T04:25:41.497881+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T09:52:34.877251+00:00","content_hash":"448fd5e8ce8039388eae8d4c95ff525f5ab1c81fc54e0784a07bdf05d4d71e4b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T09:58:47.245579+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}